# Keep LF line endings on every OS so `npm run build` output (LF) always matches
# what git checks out. Without this, Windows (core.autocrlf=true) converts pages to
# CRLF and `npm run check` / the Site check action report them as out of date.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.pdf binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.JPEG binary
*.webp binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.woff2 binary
